00:08:01.939 --> 00:08:05.939
I knew there were a few real gentlemen left in this town.

00:08:05.939 --> 00:08:07.939
Nice guy, nice hands.

00:08:07.939 --> 00:08:09.939
These?

00:08:09.939 --> 00:08:10.939
Sure.

00:08:10.939 --> 00:08:11.939
Strong.

00:08:11.939 --> 00:08:12.939
Agile.

00:08:12.939 --> 00:08:16.939
Perfect for hacking the NSA mainframe.

00:08:16.939 --> 00:08:18.939
