00:08:29.379 --> 00:08:35.379
A few months ago, you infiltrated a classified government firewall.

00:08:35.379 --> 00:08:38.379
Starhawk. Ring any bells?

00:08:38.379 --> 00:08:42.379
Took us some time, but we traced the federal offense to your computer.

00:08:42.379 --> 00:08:43.379
Lady, that...

00:08:43.379 --> 00:08:45.379
That wasn't me. It was...

00:08:45.379 --> 00:08:49.250
Look, I'm not your James Bond.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.250
I went to a Halloween party once as James Bond.

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:52.250
Everyone thought it was the Matri-D.

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:53.750
Relax, 007.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:55.750
You're not our target. She is.

00:08:55.750 --> 00:09:00.750
We have reason to believe that your girlfriend is working for a terrorist sleeper cell.

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:03.750
Look, I know the feds like to throw the T-word around willy-nilly,

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:06.750
but trust me, Chloe, she's not dangerous.

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:09.750
It never starts as dangerous.

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.750
It starts as long hours at work.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.750
A few missed dates.

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:14.750
Then there's those mysterious.

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.750
And there's those mysterious phone calls.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:21.750
She's compromised government-run power grids, cellular towers, DMV records.

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.750
Why don't you just ask her?

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.750
If she knows that we're onto her, we'll never know her endgame.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.750
You have the one thing that we don't.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.750
Her trust.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:35.750
And unless you want to write love letters from the federal pen,

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:39.750
it's up to you to figure out what it is she's after

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:46.529
and tell us before she pulls the trigger.

00:09:46.529 --> 00:09:47.529
You're going to need this.

00:09:47.529 --> 00:09:54.269
Chloe Sullivan is not who she says she is.

00:09:54.269 --> 00:10:12.049
Lunch! Right!

00:10:12.049 --> 00:10:13.049
Ah!

00:10:13.049 --> 00:10:16.049
Today is so not my day for remembering to eat.

00:10:16.049 --> 00:10:20.049
There's no biggie. You probably just can get the reminder text.

00:10:20.049 --> 00:10:22.049
Uh, did I send?

00:10:22.049 --> 00:10:24.049
My phone's been on silent.

00:10:24.049 --> 00:10:29.049
Look, Jimmy, I'm sorry I've been so blindsided by this career shift

00:10:29.049 --> 00:10:32.049
and unpacking my entire life.

00:10:32.049 --> 00:10:35.049
Well, that would explain all the late nights.

00:10:35.049 --> 00:10:37.049
Why didn't you say something off?

00:10:37.049 --> 00:10:38.049
pro when it comes to phone, peanut.

00:10:38.049 --> 00:10:39.049
But no, no.

00:10:39.049 --> 00:10:40.049
Sorry.

00:10:40.049 --> 00:10:41.049
Oh.

00:10:41.049 --> 00:10:47.330
Uh, uh, just moving into Lana's office is kind of a private thing.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.330
Yeah.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.330
I'm starting to sense that.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:56.139
Sorry, I gotta take this.

00:10:56.139 --> 00:10:58.840
I heard that text loud and clear.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:00.840
My ears are practically ringing over here.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:05.779
