00:12:10.179 --> 00:12:13.179
All the FAA will tell me is that you've been red flagged.

00:12:13.179 --> 00:12:16.179
I ran it up to the highest level.

00:12:16.179 --> 00:12:17.179
The name,

00:12:17.179 --> 00:13:12.559
See, Ms. Domestic Security, there's nothing here.

