Hey, I came as soon as I got your message. What's going on?

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:49.940
You need to read this.

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:51.940
Claire, you know I can't read Kryptonian. What am I looking at?

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:53.940
That page wasn't there before.

00:13:53.940 --> 00:14:01.240
Okay, this entry didn't just magically read a Skeeter itself into Swan's Journal.

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:03.240
Look, I know it sounds crazy.

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:07.240
But these are the only transmissions Jarrell sent to Earth before I got here.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:10.240
There's no way I missed a single page.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:16.470
Trust me, it wasn't there till now.

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:18.470
You do realize that your greatest superpowers.

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:20.470
