00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:24.470
Can you translate it?

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:28.470
No. Even Swan said these transmissions were distorted and incomplete.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:34.929
Oh, okay, Clark, now that look kills me.

00:14:34.929 --> 00:14:39.429
This transmission says, saved Lana at Fortress.

00:14:39.429 --> 00:14:41.429
Lana?

00:14:41.429 --> 00:14:44.429
