00:14:50.429 --> 00:14:52.429
Why would Jarrell send an SOS out for her?

00:14:52.429 --> 00:14:53.429
I think it's something.

00:14:53.429 --> 00:14:55.429
time I ask him myself.

00:14:55.429 --> 00:14:57.429
Wait a minute, Clark. This could be a trick.

00:14:57.429 --> 00:15:02.429
Your birth father tried to turn you into a popsicle so you would outlive everyone here on earth.

00:15:02.429 --> 00:15:04.429
