00:15:09.429 --> 00:15:12.429
If that means going up against Jeryl, then so be it.

00:15:12.429 --> 00:15:31.230
Hey, C.K.

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:34.230
Jimmy, listen, I was just on my way out.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:39.230
I only had to stop twice for directions to get here, half tank of gas, but it's not important.

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:40.230
You know, I can wait.

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:42.230
You know, what's going on?

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:46.960
You know, I wouldn't come to you if I didn't think that you could help.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:55.460
I have this friend who's keeping this really, really big secret.

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:58.460
I mean, it's kind of humongous.

00:15:58.460 --> 00:16:01.769
How'd you find out about this secret?

00:16:01.769 --> 00:16:06.720
I can't say that it wasn't a little suspicious.

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:10.720
Like, it's hard to be around someone with crazy skills like this and not think that something is up.

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:15.059
So I did a little digging.

00:16:15.059 --> 00:16:18.059
I want to found CK to be honest with you.

00:16:18.059 --> 00:16:22.019
Honest with Ye. It's freaking me out.

00:16:22.019 --> 00:16:26.019
I don't know where you're getting your information, but I can explain.

00:16:26.019 --> 00:16:29.019
That a person that I thought I knew isn't who she says she is.

00:16:29.019 --> 00:16:30.019
She?

00:16:30.019 --> 00:16:31.019
Yeah.

00:16:31.019 --> 00:16:35.019
I mean, name me one good reason to lie to somebody that you supposedly care about.

00:16:35.019 --> 00:16:38.289
To protect them.

00:16:38.289 --> 00:16:45.649
If you look at the relationship you have with this friend, do you really need to know everything about her?

00:16:45.649 --> 00:16:50.649
Or is knowing what's truly in her heart enough to know you can trust her.

00:16:50.649 --> 00:17:13.009
You mentioned Lonnie in your last transmission.

00:17:13.009 --> 00:17:14.009
Why?

00:17:14.009 --> 00:17:15.009
Why?

00:17:15.009 --> 00:17:21.200
Tell me how to save her.

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:29.049
Kara.

00:17:29.049 --> 00:17:34.539
Dura, what have you done to Kara?

00:17:34.539 --> 00:17:38.519
Why are you doing this?

00:17:38.519 --> 00:17:39.519
No.

00:17:39.519 --> 00:17:40.519
Nope.

00:17:40.519 --> 00:17:41.519
Nope.

00:17:45.779 --> 00:17:46.779
Definitely.

00:17:46.779 --> 00:17:49.279
Definitely not.

00:17:49.279 --> 00:17:50.279
Definitely not.

00:17:50.279 --> 00:17:53.279
It wants to kill you.

00:17:53.279 --> 00:17:55.279
Where are you?

00:17:55.279 --> 00:17:56.279
I get back.

00:17:56.279 --> 00:18:03.619
One crypto.

00:18:03.619 --> 00:18:19.119
Nope.

00:18:19.119 --> 00:18:20.119
Nope.

00:18:20.119 --> 00:18:21.119
Nope.

00:18:21.119 --> 00:18:29.750
Definitely not.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:30.750
All right.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:31.750
Let's see if we can find another one.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:42.140
way into this building.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.140
The ace of clubs.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:53.990
Hey, Clark, I know that being in the fortress means you're technically out of cell phone range,

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:57.990
but I found a satellite that has a possible read on Brainiac.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:04.990
Now, it's connected to the city satellite center, so I can't hack in, but I do, however,

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:16.950
think I found another way in.

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:18.950
Oh my God.

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:20.950
Who's playing your brother on me?

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:25.250
Jimmy.

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:27.250
Why are you spying one guy?

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:47.299
Why are you spying on me?

00:19:47.299 --> 00:19:49.299
Hey, Chloe.

00:19:49.299 --> 00:19:51.299
I like I really screwed up.

00:19:51.299 --> 00:19:52.299
Big time.

00:19:52.299 --> 00:19:54.299
Can you call me back?

00:19:54.299 --> 00:19:56.299
You don't want to do that.

00:19:56.299 --> 00:19:58.299
For you the word of this to Chloe?

00:19:58.299 --> 00:20:01.299
And you are both facing charges of federal treason.

00:20:01.299 --> 00:20:03.299
Look, I searched Chloe's office like you wanted me to.

00:20:03.299 --> 00:20:04.299
