00:20:04.299 --> 00:20:05.299
Drop it.

00:20:05.299 --> 00:20:10.299
The spyware that you installed in Chloe's office traced her recent computer activity.

00:20:10.299 --> 00:20:13.299
She has a plan and it's going down tonight.

00:20:13.299 --> 00:20:14.299
This can't be happy.

00:20:14.299 --> 00:20:15.299
I need you to do.

00:20:15.299 --> 00:20:17.299
man up right now.

00:20:17.299 --> 00:20:21.299
Any minute, I'm guessing, Chloe's going to invite you to a bar called the ace of clubs.

00:20:21.299 --> 00:20:24.299
