00:20:24.299 --> 00:20:29.299
Wear it. There's a fiber optic camera inside so I can keep an eye on you.

00:20:29.299 --> 00:20:33.299
So we can both watch my girlfriend drink Cosmos till she finds her inner Shakira?

00:20:33.299 --> 00:20:36.299
